    D: "hard-working: trains or works relentlessly",
    Z: "lazy: naps, slacks, avoids effort",
    A: "mature: emotionally steady and responsible (the low end is childish)",
    R: "reckless: charges in without a plan",
    J: "fun: the life of the party",
    O: "falls in love fast / easily",
    F: "food: a big eater, food on the brain",
